(21. Site Etiquette & Responsible Visiting) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.176 g
50. 762.4900000000000091 Td
(• Chichén Itzá is a protected World Heritage site and a sacred place to living Maya communities.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.176 g
50. 742.6899999999999409 Td
(• Never climb on restricted structures, touch carvings or remove stones or plants.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.176 g
50. 722.8899999999999864 Td
(• Stay on marked paths and respect barriers and staff instructions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.176 g
50. 703.0899999999999181 Td
(• Some structures are closed without notice for conservation or ceremony — never enter closed areas.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.176 g
50. 683.2899999999999636 Td
(• Ask before photographing people, and keep voices low in ceremonial spaces.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.176 g
50. 663.4900000000000091 Td
(• Drone use is restricted and generally not permitted.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.176 g
50. 643.6899999999999409 Td
